      "Fix existing security and clinical-safety gaps before adding features",
      "Every advertised module must have working implementation and tests",
      "Every patient operation must be tenant, facility, patient, and permission scoped",
      "No external API or standards claim unless conformance is tested",
      "All clinical actions require auditability and explicit human accountability",
      "Development features must never be enabled in production",
      "No mock, fake, hardcoded, or demo response may be presented as a real integration",
      "Country-specific policies and standards must be configurable",
      "A production deployment must be reproducible from a clean database"
    ]
  },
